   "html": "<p>A researcher claims that more than 65% of college students prefer online learning over in-person classes.<br />\nA previous study found that the proportion was 0.65.<br />\nIn a recent survey of <em>n</em> = 2500 students, <em>x</em> = 1700 said they prefer online learning.<br />\nWhich of the following hypothesis pairs should be used to test the claim?</p>\n\n<div> </div>\n\n<div><img alt=\"\" src=\"media/61/616bff12bd4a52694647.png\" /></div>",
